Set configuration values

Usage: vendo profile set [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --api-key <key>   API key for authentication
      --base-url <url>  Base URL for the Vendo API
      --account <id>    Account ID to operate on
      --json            Output raw JSON
  -h, --help            Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo profile set --api-key <key>
  $ vendo profile set --account <id>
  $ vendo profile set --api-key <key> --account <id>
